# Hi, I'm Valéria! 👋

### Computational Linguist | PhD Candidate | AI Specialist

I work at the intersection of **Interactional Linguistics** and **Machine Learning**. My research focuses on how spontaneous speech phenomena—like hesitations and disfluencies—impact the reliability and calibration of Large Language Models (LLMs).

---

### 🛠️ What I'm working on
- **PhD Research:** Developing a functional typology of hesitations for LLM auditing.
- **Pragmatic Blindness:** Investigating why models become overconfident when faced with human uncertainty markers.
- **Calibration & Trust:** Using metrics like ECE (Expected Calibration Error) and OE (Overconfidence Error) to evaluate model behavior on naturalistic data (Roda Viva Corpus).

### 🚀 Tech Stack & Tools
- **Languages:** Python (Pandas, NumPy, Scikit-learn), R, SQL.
- **NLP & AI:** PyTorch, Hugging Face, Transformers, LLM Evaluation (Llama-3, BERT).
- **Linguistics:** Corpus Linguistics, Pragmatics, Jeffersonian Transcription, UAM CorpusTool.
- **Professional:** AI Project Management, Data Curation, Conversational Intelligence.

